{"page":456,"verses":[{"verse_key":"38:43","surah":38,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا لَهُۥٓ أَهْلَهُۥ وَمِثْلَهُم مَّعَهُمْ رَحْمَةً مِّنَّا وَذِكْرَىٰ لِأُو۟لِى ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and We restored his family to him, with many more like them: a sign of Our mercy and a lesson to all who understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَهَبْنَا","en_gloss":"And We granted","transliteration":"wawahabnā","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"[to] him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his family","transliteration":"ahlahu","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمِثْلَهُم","en_gloss":"and a like of them","transliteration":"wamith'lahum","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّعَهُمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"maʿahum","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَّا","en_gloss":"from Us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَذِكْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"and a Reminder","transliteration":"wadhik'rā","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِأُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"for those of understanding","transliteration":"li-ulī","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"for those of understanding","transliteration":"l-albābi","verse_key":"38:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:43"}]},{"verse_key":"38:44","surah":38,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"وَخُذْ بِيَدِكَ ضِغْثًا فَٱضْرِب بِّهِۦ وَلَا تَحْنَثْ ۗ إِنَّا وَجَدْنَـٰهُ صَابِرًا ۚ نِّعْمَ ٱلْعَبْدُ ۖ إِنَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘Take a small bunch of grass in your hand, and strike [her] with that so as not to break your oath.’ We found him patient in adversity; an excellent servant! He, too, always turned to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَخُذْ","en_gloss":"And take","transliteration":"wakhudh","verse_key":"38:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِيَدِكَ","en_gloss":